
@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra trang thai API - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nop bai hop le - 201 Created
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assignmentId": 1,
    "studentCode": "DTC245200016",
    "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/trungdtt123-cmd/EduSubmit-DTC245200016"
}

### 4. Nop bai khong hop le - 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assignmentId": 0,
    "studentCode": "",
    "repositoryUrl": ""
}
### 5. Tra cuu GUID khong ton tai - 404
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
### Tra cuu luot nop ton tai - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/039ed92f-8aa9-43d5-85ae-7abc67b4054e